    {
      "question": "e-12444",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
      "old_sha256": "e9ac8b3643ae9a09ce28e555b81d20eaf2fdf317d1450b75c93a9f92d63e9395",
      "new_sha256": "24d90315534e7e6766a2adf03c0346eb210cffedb13cc78004e6456df5ce1e91",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-12444",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "First, we find the vector equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =p+tv \\\\ r & =\u27e81,2,0\u27e9+t\u27e8-4,1,1\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t \\in (-\\infty, \\infty).$\n\nSince $A$ lies on the line, we know that there must be a real number $t$ such that\n\n$$\n\\overrightarrow{OA} = \\langle 1, 2, 0 \\rangle + t \\langle -4, 1, 1 \\rangle\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PA} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}-\\overset{\\to }{OP} \\\\  & =(\u27e81,2,0\u27e9+t\u27e8-4,1,1\u27e9)-\u27e81,2,0\u27e9 \\\\  & =t\\,\u27e8-4,\\,1,\\,1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-4t,\\,t,\\,t\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $PA=6\\sqrt{2},$ we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}PA & =6\\sqrt{2} \\\\ |\\overset{\\to }{PA}| & =6\\sqrt{2} \\\\ |\u27e8-4t,\\,t,\\,t\u27e9| & =6\\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\sqrt{(-4t)^{2}+{t}^{2}+{t}^{2}} & =6\\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\sqrt{18{t}^{2}} & =6\\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\pm 3t\\sqrt{2} & =6\\sqrt{2} \\\\ t & =\\pm 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, putting the values $t=\\pm 2$ into the equation for the line, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\overset{\\to }{O{A}_{1}}=\u27e81,2,0\u27e9+2\u27e8-4,1,1\u27e9=\u27e8-7,4,2\u27e9, \\\\  & \\overset{\\to }{O{A}_{2}}=\u27e81,2,0\u27e9-2\u27e8-4,1,1\u27e9=\u27e89,0,-2\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the points are $A_1(-7, 4, 2)$ and $A_2(9, 0, -2).$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/example-12444.json",
          "file_sha256": "6062ec4fbb2f176a2740b761469e35404432e7bc25608ba488a8f8425503035b"
        }
