          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Using $\\mathbf{i},\\mathbf{j},\\mathbf{k}$ notation, find a parametrization of the line segment $\\overline{PQ},$ where $P(-4,1,2)$ and $Q(-2,5,-1).$",
